# IslandCardsB4: the island-card re-check of 17 Nov (B4). Screen TESSERA-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Runs in both looks (no look lines). One activity at a time, so the focus card shows.
setup python3 -c 'import json, os;p = os.path.expanduser("~/.config/tessera/config.json"); c = json.load(open(p)); c.setdefault("island", {})["activityMode"] = "one"; json.dump(c, open(p, "w"), indent=4)'
wait 2

# ── The timer's and the stopwatch's cards
ipc timer toggle
wait 1
ipc timer stopwatch
wait 2
ptr move 1500 600
ptr glide 960 14 300
wait 1.2
shot stopwatch-card
note stopwatch card (newest takes the focus): a 44 px badge (Material: a cookie in primary), "Stopwatch" over a big m:ss.cc that counts hundredths, reset / lap / pause on the right; two page dots under it
rec swap 1.5 ipc island next
note the focus moves to the timer: the card fades and slides in from its side (QML also fades the old one out first)
shot timer-card
note timer card: "Focus" over the big time left, reset / pause / skip on the right, a progress line along the bottom (Material: wavy)
ptr glide 960 700 300
wait 0.5
rec phase-end 3 ipc timer skip
note the phase ends: an island alert "Focus session done · Take a break" with the coffee icon turning in (no desktop notification)
wait 4
ipc timer reset
ipc timer stopwatchReset
wait 1

# ── The glyphs' motions (each recorded from the post)
rec glyph-wifi 2.2 ipc island demo wifi
note Wi-Fi: the arcs fill in none → low → medium → high (~260/430/600 ms), then the icon swells 1.15 and back
ipc island dismissNewest
wait 0.6
rec glyph-battery 2.2 ipc island demo battery
note low battery: the ring fills to 10 % (900 ms after 180), the disc glows twice, the glyph shakes ±3 px three times
ipc island dismissNewest
wait 0.6
rec glyph-charging 2.2 ipc island demo charging
note charging: the ring fills to 64 %, the bolt pulses to 1.25 twice after 400 ms
ipc island dismissNewest
wait 0.6
rec glyph-device 2.2 ipc island demo device
note device: the earbuds' drawing pops in, two ripples spread from it (140 + 260 ms apart)
ipc island dismissNewest
wait 0.6
rec glyph-audio 2.4 ipc island demo audio
note audio: three sound-wave arcs pulse beside the headphones (three times each), then stay
ipc island dismissNewest
wait 0.6
rec glyph-usb 2 ipc island demo usb
note USB: the drive icon drops 14 px and bounces in
ipc island dismissNewest
wait 0.6
rec glyph-temp 3.2 ipc island demo temperature
note temperature: the ring fills and (Glass) warms from orange to red; after 900 ms the thermometer swells with a red glow, twice
ipc island hot false
ipc island dismissNewest
wait 0.6

# ── Focus on / off
rec focus-on 2 ipc focus toggle dnd
note a Focus alert (the mode's icon and name, its status)
ipc island dismissNewest
wait 0.6
ipc focus toggle dnd
wait 1.5
shot focus-off
note "Focus off"
ipc island dismissNewest
wait 0.6

# ── The volume row's list (IslandLevels)
ipc island demo output
wait 0.5
ptr glide 1124 36 250
ptr click
wait 0.8
shot levels-list
note the outputs (a tick on the one in use), "App volumes ›" when something plays, "Sound settings"
ptr glide 960 700 300
wait 3
ipc island dismissNewest
wait 1

# ── Captions in the island
setup python3 -c 'import json, os;p = os.path.expanduser("~/.config/tessera/config.json"); c = json.load(open(p)); c.setdefault("captions", {}).update({"enabled": True, "placement": "island"}); json.dump(c, open(p, "w"), indent=4)'
wait 2
ipc captions demo "The quick brown fox jumps" "over the lazy dog"
wait 1
shot captions-pill
note the pill: closed-captioning icon and the latest words (or "Live captions")
ptr glide 960 14 300
wait 1.2
shot captions-card
note the open card: "Live captions", the last lines (or the set-up hint without whisper), an × that turns them off
ptr glide 960 700 300
setup python3 -c 'import json, os;p = os.path.expanduser("~/.config/tessera/config.json"); c = json.load(open(p)); c.setdefault("captions", {})["enabled"] = False; json.dump(c, open(p, "w"), indent=4)'
wait 2
